00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Just another period western meta comedy short film.

2
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:18,000
The Gunfighter is a comedy, western film directed by Eric Kissack.

3
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:54,000
In the tradition of classic westerns, a narrator sets up the
story of a lone gunslinger who walks into a saloon.

4
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:30,000
However, the people in this saloon can hear the narrator and the
narrator may just be a little bit bloodthirsty.

5
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:06,000
Gunfighter, played by Shawn Parsons.

6
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:42,000
Tommy Henderson, played by Scott Beehner.

7
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:18,000
Johnny Henderson, played by Brace Harris.

8
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:54,000
Sally, played by Eileen O'Connell.

9
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:30,000
Sam, played by Jordan Black.

10
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:06,000
Bill Jessup, played by Timothy Brennen.

11
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:42,000
The Gunfighter is a 2014 short film directed by Eric Kissack.

12
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:18,000
A twist on the Western genre, the film concerns a group of people in a saloon who, in an
act of breaking the fourth wall, are able to hear the narrator of the film.

13
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:54,000
The film explores themes of parody, breaking the fourth wall, short film.

14
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:30,000
The tone is lighthearted.
